Subject: Compile original NL bundle flow with native Wii words and callback ownership
Upstream-base: f75ccf1ad20e5bd7585962990db08067c0ae498a

Preserve original bundle selection, search order, seeks, read counts and callback
sequence. Adapt exact Wii16-byte header/12-byte entries at the data boundary,
retain pointer-sized contexts and owning game allocations, and drain raw NL
workers before freeing cancelled metadata. Global host new/delete is unchanged.

